1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,230
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:01,231 --> 00:00:03,211
slide forward controlling his wrist

3
00:00:03,212 --> 00:00:05,377
the other arm towards his face for the atemi

4
00:00:06,278 --> 00:00:08,874
Hold his wrist and elbow turning the body,

5
00:00:08,875 --> 00:00:10,009
cut down,

6
00:00:10,910 --> 00:00:14,101
step forward to Uke
maintaining the same extension.

7
00:00:14,502 --> 00:00:18,345
Keeping Uke´s arm straight
apply pressure to the back of the elbow,

8
00:00:18,646 --> 00:00:23,870
raise Uke´s elbow up pushing the wrist underneath
beyond 90 degrees,

9
00:00:23,871 --> 00:00:26,886
apply pressure to the back of the elbow for the pin.

